  "description": "Vali-Mediator integration for Vali-Validation. Targets net7.0/net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.\n            Adds a ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse> that validates IRequest objects\n            before they reach their handler. When TResponse is Result<T>, validation\n            failures are returned as Result.Fail(errors, ErrorType.Validation) — no exceptions\n            needed. For other response types, throws ValidationException.\n            Package name: Vali-Validation.ValiMediator. Requires Vali-Mediator.",
