  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0\n            - Adds net10.0 to the multi-targeted frameworks (now net7.0/net8.0/net9.0/net10.0).\n            - Now depends on Vali-Validation 3.0.0+, which brings Severity-aware ValidationResult,\n              RuleSets, block-level When/Unless, InjectValidator, Localization (English/Spanish\n              built in), ValiValidationOptions.Global, and PropertyValidator to any validator run\n              through this pipeline behavior. No changes to this package's own public API.\n\n            v1.0.0 — Initial release of Vali-Validation.ValiMediator.\n            - ValidationBehavior<TRequest, TResponse> implementing Vali-Mediator IPipelineBehavior.\n            - Validates request via IValidator<TRequest> resolved from DI.\n            - When TResponse is Result<T>: returns Result.Fail(errors, ErrorType.Validation) — no throw.\n            - When TResponse is any other type: throws ValidationException.\n            - AddValiValidationBehavior() extension on ValiMediatorConfiguration.\n            - AddValiMediatorWithValidation() convenience extension on IServiceCollection.",
